# Backend specific
backend/logs/
backend/*.log

# Database dumps and backups, at ANY depth (PSY-1790). Depth matters: the
# old rule was the single literal `backend/backups/`, but
# `backend/scripts/railway-migrate-prod.sh` writes `./backups/prod-backup-*.sql`
# relative to the CALLER's cwd, with no `cd` guard — run it from anywhere but
# backend/ and a production pg_dump lands somewhere the old rule did not
# reach. This repo is public, so a stray `git add -A` there publishes real
# user rows. `*-backup-*.sql` is listed because that script's filenames match
# none of the other patterns. Migrations are safe: no name under
# db/migrations/ contains `_dump_` or `-backup-`.
**/backups/
**/backup_*.tar.gz
**/*_dump_*.sql
**/*-backup-*.sql

# Go coverage output (PSY-1790). Every `.out` under backend/ is a coverage
# profile, and nothing reads one it did not just write. Nine had been
# committed under nine different ad-hoc names, so the rule is a wildcard:
# the producers are hand-typed `-coverprofile=` flags, not one script.
# `coverage.html` is named exactly, NOT `*.html` — catalog/testdata/*.html
# are tracked fixtures. If a golden-file test ever adopts the conventional
# testdata/*.out extension, narrow this rule: `git add` on an ignored path
# fails silently, so the symptom would be a fixture that never lands.
backend/**/*.out
backend/**/coverage.html

# Stray cmd/ binaries built in-place by `go build ./cmd/...` from inside
# backend/ (PSY-429, PSY-1550). Explicit names only — a glob like `backend/*`
# would match too much. Now the FULL set: the old list held 8 of the then-29
# targets, and `backend/gen-api-token` (17MB) was sitting untracked and
# unignored as a result. Regenerate with `ls backend/cmd`; three legacy names
# below outlive their packages, kept so an old binary on an old machine still
# matches. `main` is the Dockerfile's own `-o` target, hit by anyone
# reproducing the image build by hand. Duplicated in backend/.dockerignore —
# update both.
backend/apply-link-suggestions
backend/backfill-artist-bandcamp-embeds
backend/backfill-artist-discography
backend/backfill-artist-location
backend/backfill-artist-member-edges
backend/backfill-artist-state
backend/backfill-commons-photos
backend/backfill-cover-art
backend/backfill-entity-metro
backend/backfill-release-links
backend/backfill-slugs
backend/backfill-spotify-images
backend/backfill-venue-slugs
backend/backfill-venue-timezones
backend/community-gamma-sweep
backend/dedup-radio-shows
backend/dedup-shows
backend/discovery-import
backend/disparity-analysis
backend/festival-entry
backend/gen-api-token
backend/gen-e2e-seed
backend/geocode-venue-addresses
backend/link-release-labels
backend/main
backend/scaffold
backend/scrape-import
backend/seed
backend/server
backend/sweep-link-suggestions
backend/upgrade-scene-scopes
backend/verify-artist-states

